Scope

This license covers the original code, configuration and documentation of this
project. It does not cover third-party material, which keeps its own terms:

- mujoco_menagerie/ and unitree_mujoco/: see the LICENSE file in each folder.
- mpc-and-rl-benchmark/: data and figures imported from the motivating
  benchmark by S. Akki and T. Chen (https://github.com/RoLACLab/mpc-and-rl-benchmark).
- paper/IEEEtran.cls: the IEEE LaTeX class, distributed under its own terms.

The released trial datasets and trained policies are licensed separately under
CC BY 4.0; see LICENSE-DATA.
